-----BEGIN MAKTABA LICENSE-SERVER PUBLIC KEY PLACEHOLDER-----
This file is a build-time placeholder for the Maktaba license-server
Ed25519 public key (Story 16.4: "Server bundles license-server public
key at build time").

In a real release the CI build overwrites this file with the actual
SPKI/PEM-encoded Ed25519 public key of the license-signing service,
e.g.:

    -----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----
    MCowBQYDK2VwAyEA<base64-der>
    -----END PUBLIC KEY-----

While this placeholder is in place the embedded verifier reports
ErrNoEmbeddedKey, and the /api/admin/license endpoint is *disabled*
(returns 503 Service Unavailable) rather than trusting a zero key or
crashing. This is fail-closed by construction: no key -> no premium.
-----END MAKTABA LICENSE-SERVER PUBLIC KEY PLACEHOLDER-----
